  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be completed within the three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - 2.\tPrior to the occupation, details of cycle parking provision shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The spaces shall be permanently available and not be used for any other purpose.",
    "Condition : 3 - 3.\tPrior to the occupation, details of the arrangements for storing of waste and recycled materials have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The arrangements for storing waste and recycled materials shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to the occupation at the site, a scheme shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority describing the means by which future residents of this development shall be excluded from the Local Car Parking Permit Scheme. The development shall only be carried out and occupied in accordance with that approved scheme."
